* **"What specific financial questions will opposing counsel likely ask during discovery or at the conference?"**
* **"How should I explain the financial details that led to the eviction without harming my standing in the custody case?"**
* **"What financial disclosures or updated sworn financial statements (which are standard in Colorado family law) will I need to provide?"**

